SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the source code in this repository and nothing else.

  * Transit data (stops, routes, vehicle positions, arrival estimates) is
    retrieved at runtime from OASA's telematics service. It belongs to OASA
    and is NOT licensed here. Nothing in this repository grants you any right
    to it.
  * Map tiles are © CARTO, map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, used under
    their own terms.
